{"id":"vod_sn_38966","vodId":"38966","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"在魔王城说晚安","name_cn":"在魔王城说晚安","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/23e0387ee9199af91435abe7e3ab8041.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个人类与魔族共存的世界，但是世界的支配权还是掌握在人类的受众。一天，魔王抓走并囚禁了人类公主栖夜莉丝（水濑祈 配音），并且向人类发出了勒索信，要求人类用世界的支配权来换回公主的自由。为了拯救公主，勇者拂晓（下野纮 配音）踏上了充满了危机的旅途。　　然而，被囚禁的日子实在是太过于无聊了，古灵精怪又闲不住的栖夜莉丝决定在魔王城里找点乐子。无论是恶魔教会的法师雷欧纳多（石川界人 配音）还是世代侍奉魔王的忠犬哈士奇（小林亲弘 配音），甚至连威风凛凛的魔王（松冈祯丞 配音）本人，都被公主的恶作剧给耍得团团转。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DnqhwnXn8j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cWTjzfATS01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/AXMY1hmntG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/i4zzWa0Rrp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3zMS3s1tR81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bmEndN662d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Tj5ZHqxKu01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UvxsZ2msu81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rpzqRaNmhY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jHDXiaVrhY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8RXKgDkVDx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/eRvEnaU7Fs1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:52.309Z"}